rate-adjusting-pcm-ring (2.0.0~alpha1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Publish the Rust-owned canonical-F32 ABI-major-2 shared object.
  * Depend on the separately versioned dynamic sample-rate adapter.
  * Remove the obsolete ABI-major-one S16 compatibility facade and packages;
    consumers must use the canonical-F32 ABI-major-2 interface.

